{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0002-add-two-numbers","title":"LeetCode 2 两数相加","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0002-add-two-numbers","wordCount":943,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-2-两数相加\">LeetCode 2 两数相加</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你两个<strong>非空</strong>的链表，表示两个非负的整数。它们每位数字都是按照<strong>逆序</strong>的方式存储的，并且每个节点只能存储<strong>一位</strong>数字。</p>\n<p>请你将两个数相加，并以相同形式返回一个表示和的链表。你可以假设除了数字 0 之外，这两个数都不会以 0 开头。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>l1 = [2,4,3]</code>, <code>l2 = [5,6,4]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[7,0,8]</code></li>\n<li>解释：342 + 465 = 807</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>l1 = [0]</code>, <code>l2 = [0]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[0]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>l1 = [9,9,9,9,9,9,9]</code>, <code>l2 = [9,9,9,9]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[8,9,9,9,0,0,0,1]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个链表中的节点数在范围 <code>[1, 100]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 9</code></li>\n<li>题目数据保证列表表示的数字不含前导零</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本题是链表操作的经典入门题。由于数字已经按逆序存储，最低位在链表头部，正好可以从头开始逐位相加，模拟手工加法的过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"模拟加法进位\">模拟加法进位</h3><p>本题的核心思想非常直观：<strong>模拟竖式加法</strong>。从两个链表的头部（最低位）开始，逐位相加，处理进位。</p>\n<p>关键要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>同步遍历两个链表</strong>：当两个链表都有节点时，取出两个值相加；当某个链表较短时，视其值为 0</li>\n<li><strong>进位处理</strong>：每次相加的结果可能大于等于 10，需要取模得到当前位的值，除以 10 得到进位</li>\n<li><strong>最终进位</strong>：遍历结束后，如果仍有进位（carry &gt; 0），需要额外创建一个节点</li>\n<li><strong>哑节点技巧</strong>：使用一个虚拟头节点（dummy node）简化链表的头部处理，避免特殊判断</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么逆序存储简化了问题？</strong> 因为加法从最低位开始，而链表从头部开始遍历，两者方向一致。如果是正序存储（高位在前），则需要先遍历到末尾或使用栈来反转顺序。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理场景</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等长链表</td>\n<td>正常逐位相加</td>\n<td>[2,4,3] + [5,6,4]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不等长链表</td>\n<td>短链表结束后视为 0</td>\n<td>[9,9] + [1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终有进位</td>\n<td>需要额外添加节点</td>\n<td>[5] + [5] → [0,1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多次连续进位</td>\n<td>进位可能传递多位</td>\n<td>[9,9,9] + [1] → [0,0,0,1]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, next?: ListNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.next = next ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function addTwoNumbers(l1: ListNode | null, l2: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  const dummy = new ListNode(0);&#10;  let current = dummy;&#10;  let carry = 0;&#10;&#10;  while (l1 !== null || l2 !== null || carry &gt; 0) {&#10;    const v1 = l1 !== null ? l1.val : 0;&#10;    const v2 = l2 !== null ? l2.val : 0;&#10;    const sum = v1 + v2 + carry;&#10;&#10;    carry = Math.floor(sum / 10);&#10;    current.next = new ListNode(sum % 10);&#10;    current = current.next;&#10;&#10;    if (l1 !== null) l1 = l1.next;&#10;    if (l2 !== null) l2 = l2.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dummy.next;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addTwoNumbers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">l1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">l2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dummy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (l1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l1.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l2.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carry;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (l1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) l1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l1.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (l2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) l2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l2.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码要点解析：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dummy</code> 哑节点避免了对头节点的特殊处理，最后返回 <code>dummy.next</code> 即为结果链表的头</li>\n<li>循环条件 <code>l1 !== null || l2 !== null || carry &gt; 0</code> 确保三种情况都被处理：两链表未遍历完、有剩余进位</li>\n<li><code>sum % 10</code> 得到当前位的数字，<code>Math.floor(sum / 10)</code> 得到进位值</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>l1 = [9,9,9,9,9,9,9]</code>，<code>l2 = [9,9,9,9]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>v1</th>\n<th>v2</th>\n<th>carry(入)</th>\n<th>sum</th>\n<th>节点值</th>\n<th>carry(出)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结果链表：<code>[8,9,9,9,0,0,0,1]</code>，即 9999999 + 9999 = 10009998。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(max(m, n))</td>\n<td>m、n 为两个链表的长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(max(m, n))</td>\n<td>结果链表最多 max(m,n)+1 个节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 每个节点最多被访问一次，循环次数取决于较长的链表长度。当有最终进位时，额外执行一次循环，不影响量级。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 结果链表的长度为 max(m, n) 或 max(m, n) + 1（有最终进位时多一个节点）。如果不计算输出空间，则额外空间仅为 O(1)（carry 和指针变量）。</p>\n<p>本题是链表操作与进位模拟的完美结合。掌握哑节点技巧和进位处理模式后，可以轻松应对相关变体，如字符串相加（LC #415）、两数相加 II（LC #445，正序存储版本）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 2 两数相加","id":"leetcode-2-两数相加"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"模拟加法进位","id":"模拟加法进位"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 151 反转字符串中的单词","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0151-reverse-words-in-string"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 19 删除链表的倒数第 N 个结点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0019-remove-nth-node-from-end"}}